{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 42, :comments ["<b>And I came today.</b> Rashi's explanation: Eliezer's account is repeated, etc. According to the plain sense, it is repeated to inform you that he recounted to them how Avraham made him swear, and how Rivka happened to him through his prayer — for otherwise you would wonder how her relatives consented to him immediately, as it says: ויאמרו מאת יהוה יצא הדבר."], :book :genesis, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 24, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:05:39.109332214Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}